{"strongs": "H6316", "word": "פּוּט", "translit": "put", "root": "פוט", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, of a people", "gloss": "Libyans", "definition": "פּוּט proper name, of a people probably Libyans , or Libyan tribe; usually named with African peoples: Nah 3:9 ; Jer 46:9 ; Ezek 27:10 ; Ezek 30:5 ; Ezek 38:5 ( ᵐ5 usually Λίβυες ); Gen 10:6 ( P ) = 1Chr 1:8 ( Φουδ ); + Isa 66:19 (for ᵑ0 פּוּל ; ᵐ5 φουδ ), — see Di Gen 10:6 Jen ZA x. 325 ff .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6545')\">BDB6545</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6316')\">H6316</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6544')\">BDB6544</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6546')\">BDB6546</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>פּוּט</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a people</b> probably <highlightword>Libyans</highlightword>, or Libyan tribe; usually named with African peoples: <ref ref=\"Nah 3:9\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(34,3,9)\">Nah 3:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 46:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,9)\">Jer 46:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,10)\">Ezek 27:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 30:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,30,5)\">Ezek 30:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,5)\">Ezek 38:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> usually <grk>Λίβυες</grk>); <ref ref=\"Gen 10:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,6)\">Gen 10:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) = <ref ref=\"1Chr 1:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,1,8)\">1Chr 1:8</ref> (<grk>Φουδ</grk>); + <ref ref=\"Isa 66:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vB